# Bundled demonstration page.  Render it with:  ./ttx demo
# It lives inside the package so that building feed pages into pages/
# cannot overwrite or remove it.
!title TELETEXT DEMO
!page 100
{cyan}P100 {white}TELETEXT DEMONSTRATION{yellow}   VT340
{gred}███████████████████████████████████████
{yellow}{double}TELETEXT SIXEL

{white}Level 1 pages: 40 columns, 25 rows,
{white}eight colours, mosaic block graphics.
{blue}{newbg}{white} PAPER {yellow}INK {red}RED {green}GREEN {cyan}CYAN {bgblack}
{white}Attributes: {flash}FLASH{steady} {conceal}HIDDEN{white} shown
{white}Mosaics, 2x3 blocks per character:
!graphic row=11 col=5 colour=cyan
####################
#..................#
#..##..##..##..##..#
#..................#
#..##############..#
#..................#
####################
....############....
...##############...
!endgraphic
!graphic row=11 col=24 colour=yellow sep=1
####################
#..................#
#..##..##..##..##..#
#..................#
#..##############..#
#..................#
####################
....############....
...##############...
!endgraphic
!row 15
{cyan}contiguous{white} and {yellow}separated{white} mosaics
!row 17
{cyan}Sent as sixel this page is about 9K;
{cyan}sent as characters in the downloaded
{cyan}soft font it is under 2K, which is
{cyan}two seconds at 9600 baud.
{green}Characters are rounded the way a real
{green}teletext chip rounds them, so diagonals
{green}are not a staircase.
!row 24
{red}100 Index {green}101 News {yellow}300 Sport {cyan}Ceefax
